\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f-force\" name=\"save_as_new_version\" value=\"1\" >\n    <label for=\"f-force\">即使该来源已存在，仍将本次填写<strong>另存为新版本</strong></label>\n  </div>\n  \n  <button type=\"submit\">保存曲目</button>\n</form>\n<h2>曲目列表</h2>\n<ol class=\"tracks\"><li id=\"track-2\">\n<p class=\"track-title\"><span class=\"track-id\">#2</span>旧录音二修订<a class=\"edit-link\" href=\"/tracks/2/edit\">编辑</a></p>\n<dl class=\"track-meta\">\n<dt>来源</dt><dd>/music/archive.flac</dd>\n<dt>时长</dt><dd>71.25 秒</dd>\n<dt>封面地址</dt><dd>https://example.com/archive.jpg</dd>\n<dt>标签</dt><dd><span class=\"tag\">档案</span><span class=\"tag\">现场</span></dd>\n<dt>说明</dt><dd class=\"notes\">旧页面第一段\n第二段\n </dd>\n</dl>\n</li><li id=\"track-9\">\n<p class=\"track-title\"><span class=\"track-id\">#9</span>旧录音九修订<a class=\"edit-link\" href=\"/tracks/9/edit\">编辑</a></p>\n<dl class=\"track-meta\">\n<dt>来源</dt><dd><span class=\"unfilled\">未填写</span></dd>\n<dt>时长</dt><dd><span class=\"unfilled\">未填写</span></dd>\n<dt>封面地址</dt><dd><span class=\"unfilled\">未填写</span></dd>\n<dt>标签</dt><dd><span class=\"unfilled\">无</span></dd>\n<dt>说明</dt><dd class=\"notes\"><span class=\"unfilled\">未填写</span></dd>\n</dl>\n</li><li id=\"track-10\">\n<p class=\"track-title\"><span class=\"track-id\">#10</span>页面空资料<a class=\"edit-link\" href=\"/tracks/10/edit\">编辑</a></p>\n<dl class=\"track-meta\">\n<dt>来源</dt><dd>/music/page-retry.flac</dd>\n<dt>时长</dt><dd><span class=\"unfilled\">未知</span></dd>\n<dt>封面地址</dt><dd><span class=\"unfilled\">未填写</span></dd>\n<dt>标签</dt><dd><span class=\"unfilled\">无</span></dd>\n<dt>说明</dt><dd class=\"notes\"></dd>\n</dl>\n</li><li id=\"track-11\">\n<p class=\"track-title\"><span class=\"track-id\">#11</span>页面同来源版本<a class=\"edit-link\" href=\"/tracks/11/edit\">编辑</a></p>\n<dl class=\"track-meta\">\n<dt>来源</dt><dd>/music/page.flac</dd>\n<dt>时长</dt><dd><span class=\"unfilled\">未知</span></dd>\n<dt>封面地址</dt><dd><span class=\"unfilled\">未填写</span></dd>\n<dt>标签</dt><dd><span class=\"unfilled\"